<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>sandclaude — global settings</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/dashboard.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/xterm.css">
</head>
<body class="console">
<header class="console-header">
  <div class="brand">
    <a href="/" class="brand-back">&larr;</a>
    <span class="brand-name">sandclaude</span>
    <span class="brand-sub">global settings</span>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="global-wrap">
  <p class="global-intro">
    Settings that apply across every project. Credentials here are shared by all
    projects (a project can still override per host). Defaults are inherited by
    new projects when you run <code>sandclaude init</code>.
  </p>
  <div id="global-root"><p class="muted">loading…</p></div>
</main>

<script src="/static/xterm.js"></script>
<script src="/static/xterm-addon-fit.js"></script>
